  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers the OpenFeature specification with OpenFeature 0.9 (v0.9.0) as the current line, OpenFeature 0.8 as supported and 0.1 to 0.7 as legacy; no 1.0 exists. It teaches the evaluation API with provider mutator, domains and clients, typed and detailed flag evaluation, evaluation details, reasons and error codes, the dynamic-context and static-context paradigms, evaluation context with the targeting key and merge order, transaction context propagation, hooks with stages, ordering, hints and data, providers with resolution details, lifecycle, status and events, tracking, and the Appendix D telemetry mapping, with upgrade checklists between releases. Summarizes the OpenFeature Remote Evaluation Protocol at OpenAPI 0.4.0 (Draft posture: track), a separate protocol. Records section statuses and CNCF Incubating status.",
